  "text": "{\"title\":\"Will Central Park’s daily maximum temperature be at least 75°F on September 21, 2026?\",\"description\":\"This market resolves Yes if the daily maximum temperature for Central Park, New York, for September 21, 2026 is at least 75°F; otherwise it resolves No.\\n\\nUse the published whole-degree Fahrenheit maximum in the National Weather Service New York office’s full-day Central Park Daily Climate Report (CLI / CLINYC), with a climate-summary date of September 21, 2026. The observation period is the climate day represented by that report, beginning at 05:00 UTC (1:00 a.m. EDT) on September 21, 2026. Do not use the preliminary afternoon report, forecasts, or another weather station.\\n\\nUse the latest full-day report or correction published by September 22, 2026 at 12:00 noon America/New_York (16:00 UTC). Later revisions do not change the result. If no usable numerical maximum is available by that cutoff, this market resolves No.\",\"market_id\":\"4805182\",\"res_data\":\"p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to No, p2 to Yes, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x0A0a0A0A8B00C51b7D810501b03F230028C04a87 should be considered.\",\"product_spec\":\"\",\"version\":\"1\"},ooRequester:53703dd6129d723066b6362510e5ae2fecd48218,childRequester:2c0367a9db231ddebd88a94b4f6461a6e47c58b1,childChainId:137"
